#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:224
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Currently the only thing you can change about the game look is the color of "
"the lines. To do so use <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> on "
"the menubar. See <link linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> "
"section for details."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kappname; doesn't currently have an <quote>Undo</quote> feature."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play the game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kappname; cannot be played using keyboard."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. There is no <quote>Hint</quote> feature implemented yet."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kappname; does not have a saving feature."
msgstr ""

